{"id":"754c7d946466c30d","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support.md","title":"ZFC Forcing11 Name Support","display":"df-zfc-forcing11-name-support — ZFC Forcing11 Name Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support","58-df-zfc-forcing3-name-support"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing11-name-support — ZFC Forcing11 Name Support","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-name-support</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-name-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing11-name-support — ZFC Forcing11 Name Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,\\tau,\\sigma,S\\in V,\\ P\\in M,\\ S\\subseteq P\">\\(M,P,\\tau,\\sigma,S\\in V,\\ P\\in M,\\ S\\subseteq P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(\\tau,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}_S\\)</span> 的参数条件在 Assertion 中给出；不额外假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 对名字后裔封闭。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameDescendant}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NameSupport}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NameDescendant}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NameSupport}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}name\\text{-}descendant} \\vdash \\mathrm{NameDescendant}_S(\\sigma,\\tau,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\tau\\in M\\land P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,P)\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,P)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(u,n+1,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land\\forall i\\in n+1\\;\\mathrm{PName}_S(u(i),P)\\land u(0)=\\tau\\land u(n)=\\sigma\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\exists p_i\\in P\\;(\\langle u(i+1),p_i\\rangle\\in u(i))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}name\\text{-}descendant} \\vdash \\mathrm{NameDescendant}_S(\\sigma,\\tau,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\tau\\in M\\land P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,P)\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,P)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(u,n+1,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land\\forall i\\in n+1\\;\\mathrm{PName}_S(u(i),P)\\land u(0)=\\tau\\land u(n)=\\sigma\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\exists p_i\\in P\\;(\\langle u(i+1),p_i\\rangle\\in u(i))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}name\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S(S,\\tau,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\tau\\in M\\land P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,P)\\land S=\\{p\\in P:\\exists\\sigma,\\rho\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,P)\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\rho,P)\\land\\mathrm{NameDescendant}_S(\\sigma,\\tau,M,P)\\land\\langle\\rho,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}name\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S(S,\\tau,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\tau\\in M\\land P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,P)\\land S=\\{p\\in P:\\exists\\sigma,\\rho\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,P)\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\rho,P)\\land\\mathrm{NameDescendant}_S(\\sigma,\\tau,M,P)\\land\\langle\\rho,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}name\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NameSupport}_S(\\tau,S,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S(S,\\tau,M,P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}name\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NameSupport}_S(\\tau,S,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NameSupport}_S(S,\\tau,M,P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary name support definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing3-name-support</code> is merged here; it used the same recursively generated condition support.</li>\n<li>This is the condition support of a name, obtained from conditions occurring in the name or any finitely reachable subname. Only the root name and forcing poset are required to lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>: descendants are set-theoretic members of the name code and need not themselves be elements of a nontransitive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>. For an iteration, coordinate support is obtained by taking the union of the coordinate supports of these conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","statu